    "sourcePrompt": "3D card showcase, pure black background. 16s, 1920x1080, SILENT. Cards rock/sway side to side — NOT full 360 rotation. Use ease-in-out oscillation between rotateY(-22deg) and rotateY(22deg) so the card face is always visible, no black gap at 90deg. Combined with slight rotateX tilt that also oscillates. Name only below card\n```html\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair+Display:wght@700&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n<style>\n*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box;}\nbody,#scene{width:1920px;height:1080px;overflow:hidden;}\n#scene{\nposition:relative;background:#000000\ndisplay:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\n}\ncard-stage{position:absolute;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;opacity:0;}\ncard-wrap{\nwidth:320px;height:460px;position:relative\n/* rock side to side — never exceeds ±25deg so face always visible */\nanimation:rock 2.4s ease-in-out infinite alternate\n}\n@keyframes rock{\n0%  {transform:perspective(900px) rotateX(6deg)  rotateY(-22deg);}\n50% {transform:perspective(900px) rotateX(3deg)  rotateY(0deg);}\n100%{transform:perspective(900px) rotateX(6deg)  rotateY(22deg);}\n}\ncard-face{\nwidth:100%;height:100%;background:#fff;border-radius:6px\nbox-shadow:0 40px 90px rgba(0,0,0,0.85),0 8px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.50)\noverflow:hidden;position:relative\n}\ncard-img{\nwidth:calc(100% - 24px);height:calc(100% - 24px)\nmargin:12px;overflow:hidden;border-radius:3px;position:relative\n}\ncard-img img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;display:block;filter:grayscale(10%) contrast(1.06);}\ncard-img::after{\ncontent:\"\";position:absolute;left:-30%;top:0\nwidth:85%;padding-bottom:85%;border-radius:50%\nbackground:radial-gradient(ellipse at center,rgba(255,255,255,0.30) 0%,rgba(255,255,255,0) 70%)\npointer-events:none;animation:shiny 2.4s ease-in-out infinite alternate\n}\n/* shiny moves in sync with rock — slides left-right across card */\n@keyframes shiny{\n0%  {transform:translate(-60%,20%);}\n100%{transform:translate(80%,20%);}\n}\nrole-label{margin-top:24px;text-align:center;opacity:0;transform:translateY(10px);}\nrole-name{\nfont-family:'Playfair Display',Georgia,serif\nfont-size:46px;font-weight:700\ncolor:#f0ece4;line-height:.90;letter-spacing:-.01em\n}\n#open-fade,#close-fade{position:absolute;inset:0;z-index:50;background:#000;pointer-events:none;}\n#open-fade{opacity:1;}#close-fade{opacity:0;}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div id=\"scene\">\n<div id=\"open-fade\"></div>\n<div id=\"close-fade\"></div>\n<div class=\"card-stage\" id=\"s1\">\n<div class=\"card-wrap\"><div class=\"card-face\"><div class=\"card-img\"><img src=\"{{img1}}\" alt=\"\"></div></div></div>\n<div class=\"role-label\" id=\"l1\"><div class=\"role-name\">Alan Turing</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"card-stage\" id=\"s2\">\n<div class=\"card-wrap\"><div class=\"card-face\"><div class=\"card-img\"><img src=\"{{img2}}\" alt=\"\"></div></div></div>\n<div class=\"role-label\" id=\"l2\"><div class=\"role-name\">Sherlock Holmes</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"card-stage\" id=\"s3\">\n<div class=\"card-wrap\"><div class=\"card-face\"><div class=\"card-img\"><img src=\"{{img3}}\" alt=\"\"></div></div></div>\n<div class=\"role-label\" id=\"l3\"><div class=\"role-name\">Hamlet</div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<script src=\"vendor/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n<script>\nwindow.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded',function(){\nvar tl=gsap.timeline()\ntl.to('#open-fade',{opacity:0,duration:0.5,ease:'power2.out'},0.0)\ntl.set('#s1',{opacity:1},0.4)\ntl.to('#s1',{scale:1,duration:0.65,ease:'back.out(1.3)',startAt:{scale:0.80}},0.4)\ntl.to('#l1',{opacity:1,y:0,duration:0.5,ease:'power3.out'},0.75)\ntl.to('#l1',{opacity:0,y:-8,duration:0.35,ease:'power2.in'},4.5)\ntl.to('#s1',{opacity:0,scale:0.85,duration:0.4,ease:'power2.in'},4.6)\ntl.set('#s1',{opacity:0},5.1)\ntl.set('#s2',{opacity:1},5.0)\ntl.to('#s2',{scale:1,duration:0.65,ease:'back.out(1.3)',startAt:{scale:0.80}},5.0)\ntl.to('#l2',{opacity:1,y:0,duration:0.5,ease:'power3.out'},5.35)\ntl.to('#l2',{opacity:0,y:-8,duration:0.35,ease:'power2.in'},9.5)\ntl.to('#s2',{opacity:0,scale:0.85,duration:0.4,ease:'power2.in'},9.6)\ntl.set('#s2',{opacity:0},10.1)\ntl.set('#s3',{opacity:1},10.0)\ntl.to('#s3',{scale:1,duration:0.65,ease:'back.out(1.3)',startAt:{scale:0.80}},10.0)\ntl.to('#l3',{opacity:1,y:0,duration:0.5,ease:'power3.out'},10.35)\ntl.to('#l3',{opacity:0,y:-8,duration:0.35,ease:'power2.in'},14.5)\ntl.to('#s3',{opacity:0,scale:0.85,duration:0.4,ease:'power2.in'},14.6)\ntl.to('#close-fade',{opacity:1,duration:0.7,ease:'power2.inOut'},14.8)\ntl.set('#close-fade',{opacity:1},15.6)\n})\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>\n```",
